certified_type:
  category: Indicator
  type_designations:
  - AFS
  - AFM
  - ABM
  - ATM
  - APS
  - VFS
  - VFM
  - VBM
  - VTM
  - VPS
  module_designation:
  description: >-
    A-Series and V-Series digital indicators for connection to a weighing platform in non-automatic weighing
    instruments. Class III or IIII, self-indicating, single or dual interval/range, mains or battery powered,
    suitable for direct sales to the public. Devices/functions: zero setting and zero tracking, subtractive
    tare balancing, stability of equilibrium determination, zero and net indicators, memory/totalisation
    and printing. Load cell requirements: any compatible load cell with an R60 OIML Certificate of Conformity
    may be used, provided it contains the necessary data for the compatibility of modules declaration
    (NH-marked cells only allowed with R76 humidity testing); compatibility is verified at the time of
    verification; the transmission must conform to a standard type.
